<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Famous</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Isabel LaRosa</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Raven</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4OVK8oaLIhx9Xu0P8D3SA7</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.870" end="00:07.008">Drivin', flyin', wanna feel this forever</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.008" end="00:10.527">Tryin', cryin', God, there's so much pressure</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.527" end="00:13.508">Dyin', lyin', tryna keep it together</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.508" end="00:16.751">Boy, you just told me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.751" end="00:20.612">Hurtin', burnin', God, I can feel the tension</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.612" end="00:23.732">Worth it, honey, point my favorite lesson</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.732" end="00:27.494">Searchin', unit, you're my sick obsession</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.494" end="00:28.994">Darlin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.635" end="00:29.135" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.820" end="00:32.510">You make me feel so famous, famous</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.510" end="00:35.950">Dancin', oh yeah, you crave it, crave it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.950" end="00:39.065">Heaven's close, can you taste it, taste it?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.065" end="00:42.379">Tonight I may be your star</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.379" end="00:45.962">You make me so famous, famous</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.962" end="00:49.494">Tonight I can keep you nameless, nameless</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.494" end="00:52.617">My body loves how you trace it, trace it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.617" end="00:56.232">You're so close, it's so far</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.232" end="00:58.267" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.267" end="01:01.895">It's mornin', hungry, surrounded by pretty faces</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.895" end="01:05.264">He loves me, or does he? I swear, he just likes the chasin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.264" end="01:08.590">It's funny how he needs the validation</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.590" end="01:12.152">Say you want me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.152" end="01:15.723">Breathin', believin', baby, I'm lost in those eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.723" end="01:19.101">Speedin', needin' your hands all over my thighs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.101" end="01:22.756">Secrets, demons, God, they make me so high</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.756" end="01:24.256">Darlin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.753" end="01:25.253" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.970" end="01:27.608">You make me feel so famous, famous</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.608" end="01:30.420">Dancin', oh yeah, you crave it, crave it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.420" end="01:33.971">Heaven's close, can you taste it, taste it?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.971" end="01:36.945">Tonight I may be your star</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.945" end="01:40.651">You make me feel so famous, famous</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.651" end="01:44.171">Tonight I can keep you nameless, nameless</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.171" end="01:47.450">My body loves how you trace it, trace it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.450" end="01:50.368">You're so close, it's so far</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.368" end="01:54.525" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.525" end="01:57.652">Famous, famous</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.652" end="02:01.085">Taste it, taste it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.085" end="02:03.710">Famous, famous</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.710" end="02:05.210" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.727" end="02:08.591">You make me feel so famous, famous</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.591" end="02:11.848">Dancin', oh yeah, you crave it, crave it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.848" end="02:14.962">Heaven's close, can you taste it, taste it?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.962" end="02:18.358">Tonight I may be your star</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.358" end="02:21.968">You make me so famous, famous</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.968" end="02:25.400">Tonight I can keep you nameless, nameless</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.400" end="02:28.770">My body loves how you trace it, trace it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.770" end="02:31.706">You're so close, it's so far</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.706" end="02:35.527" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.527" end="02:38.722">Famous, famous</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.722" end="02:42.287">Taste it, taste it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.287" end="02:46.287">Famous, famous</p></div></body></tt>